        rdfs:comment                   "Shawl, woven silk embroidered with silk thread, made for the European market, China, Qing dynasty, early 19th century"@en , "Shawl of white silk, with white silk embroidery, border of white silk net, with white silk fringes. The pattern is worked along the sides and fills the corners of the shawl, it consists of a variety of floral stems."@en ;
